        1388,
        1596,
        1465
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "NOW, THEREFORE, by the power vested in me as Mayor of New York City pursuant to law, including Executive Law § 24, I hereby proclaim a state of local emergency in New York City and order:",
      "logprob_stats": {
