      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "1. The Emergency Management, Fire, Police, Sanitation, Environmental Protection, and Transportation Commissioners shall take all appropriate and necessary steps to preserve public safety and to render all required and available assistance to protect the security, well-being and health of the residents of the City.",
      "logprob_stats": {
