        1799
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "2. The public is urged to avoid all unnecessary driving effective July 31, 2025, 3 p.m. to Friday, August 1, 8 a.m. and to use public transportation wherever possible. Members of the public who must drive to an emergency shall use extreme caution.",
